Title:  We seemed to have telepathy

Seq:    6.54.2.3

Level:  5 - Detail

Class:  quote

Attribution: [[Starr, Ringo|Ringo Starr]], as quoted in *[[Quoted in The Beatles Anthology (Ringo)|The Beatles Anthology]]*

Body:

The interesting thing about The Beatles was that we seemed to have telepathy. Without thinking, we’d all be up or bringing it down — together. It was magic…. 

